/* Hero contact controls — isolated module */
[data-header]{position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto;z-index:50;background:transparent;backdrop-filter:none;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none;border-bottom:0}
[data-header] .header-inner{padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px;justify-content:space-between}
[data-header] .header-logo{height:54px;opacity:1}
[data-header] .nav{display:none}
.header-whatsapp{margin-left:auto;min-height:56px;padding:0 24px;gap:14px}
.header-whatsapp-icon{width:28px;height:28px}
.hero-socials{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:30px;animation:heroFade 680ms var(--mo-ease) 500ms both}
.hero-social-link{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:14px;min-width:252px;min-height:68px;padding:16px 18px;border:1px solid rgba(199,156,91,.34);background:rgba(7,7,9,.48);transition:transform var(--mo-fast) var(--mo-ease),border-color var(--mo-fast) var(--mo-ease),background-color var(--mo-fast) var(--mo-ease)}
.hero-social-link--text{grid-template-columns:1fr auto}
.hero-social-link:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:rgba(199,156,91,.62);background:rgba(21,21,24,.74)}
.hero-social-icon{display:inline-grid;width:30px;height:30px}
.hero-social-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;min-width:0}.hero-social-copy strong{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:650;color:var(--mo-ivory)}.hero-social-copy small{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.25;color:var(--mo-muted-light)}

@media(max-width:780px){[data-header] .header-inner{flex-wrap:nowrap}[data-header] .header-logo{height:38px}.header-whatsapp{min-width:48px;min-height:46px;padding:9px 12px}.header-whatsapp-label{display:none}.hero{padding-top:132px}.hero-content{max-width:100%}.hero-media img{object-position:68% center}.split-head,.timeline-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid-3,.grid-4,.grid-5,.grid-8{grid-template-columns:1fr}.driver-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.driver-meta{grid-column:auto;grid-template-columns:1fr}.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.footer-mid{border-left:0;border-right:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(243,239,228,.08);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(243,239,228,.08);padding:28px 0;text-align:left}.hero-socials{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.hero-social-link{min-width:0;width:100%}.hero-proof{gap:10px 16px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.001ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important}[data-reveal]{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body data-build="motoristaops-claude-design-2026-09-05" data-icon-system="lucide" data-brand-system="brand-glyphs">
<a class="skip-link" href="#conteudo">Pular para o conteúdo</a>
<header data-header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a href="#topo" aria-label="MotoristaOPS — início"><img data-logo class="header-logo" src="/assets/logo-claude.avif" alt="MotoristaOPS por Henrico Amaral"></a>
    <a class="btn btn-primary header-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/5511988329725?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20Henrico.%20Gostaria%20de%20alinhar%20um%20trajeto%20particular." target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Agendar pelo WhatsApp">
      <span class="brand-icon brand-icon--header header-whatsapp-icon" data-brand-icon="whatsapp" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="header-whatsapp-label">Agendar pelo WhatsApp</span>
      <span class="mo-icon mo-icon--sm header-whatsapp-arrow" data-mo-icon="arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>
<main id="conteudo">
<section id="topo" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/hero-claude.avif" alt=""><div class="hero-shade-a"></div><div class="hero-shade-b"></div></div>
  <div class="container"><div class="hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Motorista particular • São Paulo • hora marcada</p>
    <h1 class="title-xl"><span>Seu compromisso</span><span>começa antes</span><span>do destino.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">Corridas particulares para aeroportos, reuniões, consultas, eventos e viagens — com planejamento, comunicação direta e cuidado do início ao fim.</p>
    <div class="hero-socials" aria-label="Canais MotoristaOPS">
      <a class="hero-social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/motoristaops/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Seguir MotoristaOPS no Instagram">
        <span class="brand-icon brand-icon--hero hero-social-icon" data-brand-icon="instagram" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="hero-social-copy"><strong>Instagram</strong><small>Siga nosso perfil</small></span>
        <span class="mo-icon mo-icon--sm hero-social-arrow" data-mo-icon="external" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </a>
      <a class="hero-social-link" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/aCAXYqSYsQDSt7teA" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Ver avaliações do MotoristaOPS no Google">
        <span class="brand-icon brand-icon--hero hero-social-icon" data-brand-icon="google" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="hero-social-copy"><strong>Google</strong><small>Ver avaliações</small></span>
        <span class="mo-icon mo-icon--sm hero-social-arrow" data-mo-icon="external" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-proof" aria-label="Principais benefícios"><span>Hora marcada</span><span>Atendimento direto</span><span>Planejamento de rota</span><span>Discrição</span></div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section id="prova-social" class="social-proof" aria-labelledby="prova-social-title">
  <div class="social-proof-shell">
    <header class="social-proof-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Prova social</p>
        <h2 id="prova-social-title" class="title-lg social-proof-title">
          <span>Confiança que</span>
          <span>vem da <span class="social-proof-title-accent">experiência.</span></span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="social-proof-intro">São milhares de viagens, avaliações reais e histórias que reforçam um mesmo compromisso: oferecer um trajeto seguro, pontual e de qualidade, sempre.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="social-proof-metrics" aria-label="Indicadores de confiança">
      <article class="social-proof-metric" data-reveal="0">
        <div class="social-proof-metric-mark"><span class="brand-icon" data-brand-icon="google" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
        <div class="social-proof-metric-copy">
          <span class="social-proof-kicker">Avaliação no Google</span>
          <p class="social-proof-value"><span>5,0</span><span class="social-proof-stars" aria-label="5 de 5 estrelas">★★★★★</span></p>
          <span class="social-proof-sub">8 avaliações</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="social-proof-metric" data-reveal="80">
        <div class="social-proof-metric-mark social-proof-uber-mark" aria-hidden="true">Uber</div>
        <div class="social-proof-metric-copy">
          <span class="social-proof-kicker">Avaliação na Uber</span>
          <p class="social-proof-value"><span>4,98</span><span class="social-proof-stars" aria-label="5 estrelas">★★★★★</span></p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="social-proof-metric" data-reveal="160">
        <div class="social-proof-metric-mark"><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--route" aria-hidden="true"><i data-lucide="route"></i></span></div>
        <div class="social-proof-metric-copy">
          <span class="social-proof-kicker">Viagens realizadas</span>
          <p class="social-proof-value">3.453</p>
          <span class="social-proof-sub">Mais de 3.400 viagens</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="social-proof-metric" data-reveal="240">
        <div class="social-proof-metric-mark"><span class="mo-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i data-lucide="calendar-days"></i></span></div>
        <div class="social-proof-metric-copy">
          <span class="social-proof-kicker">Tempo no app</span>
          <p class="social-proof-value social-proof-value--stacked"><span>3 anos</span><span>e 5 meses</span></p>
          <span class="social-proof-sub">Na Uber</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="social-proof-reviews" aria-label="Avaliações de clientes no Google">
      <article class="social-proof-review" data-reveal="0">
        <div class="social-proof-review-head">
          <a class="social-proof-review-author" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/aCAXYqSYsQDSt7teA" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Ver avaliação de Thaís Barbosa no Google">
            <span class="social-proof-review-name">Thaís Barbosa</span><span class="mo-icon" data-mo-icon="external" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </a>
          <div class="social-proof-review-meta"><span>Google</span><time>Há 3 semanas</time></div>
        </div>
        <div class="social-proof-stars social-proof-review-stars" aria-label="5 de 5 estrelas">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>“Bom atendimento, cordialidade e pontualidade, super recomendo de olhos fechados.”</blockquote>
        <div class="social-proof-review-quote" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
      </article>

      <article class="social-proof-review" data-reveal="80">
        <div class="social-proof-review-head">
          <a class="social-proof-review-author" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/aCAXYqSYsQDSt7teA" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Ver avaliação de Ricardo Melo no Google">
            <span class="social-proof-review-name">Ricardo Melo</span><span class="mo-icon" data-mo-icon="external" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </a>
          <div class="social-proof-review-meta"><span>Google</span><time>Há 3 semanas</time></div>
        </div>
        <div class="social-proof-stars social-proof-review-stars" aria-label="5 de 5 estrelas">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>“Eu sempre opto pelo Henrrique quando eu vou em festivais em São Paulo ele levar eu e a minha esposa e amigos, no final do festival, deixar cada um em casa. Ele é sempre pontual e seguro!”</blockquote>
        <div class="social-proof-review-quote" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
      </article>

      <article class="social-proof-review" data-reveal="160">
        <div class="social-proof-review-head">
          <a class="social-proof-review-author" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/aCAXYqSYsQDSt7teA" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Ver avaliação de Dani Stefanini no Google">
            <span class="social-proof-review-name">Dani Stefanini</span><span class="mo-icon" data-mo-icon="external" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </a>
          <div class="social-proof-review-meta"><span>Google</span><time>Há 3 semanas</time></div>
        </div>
        <div class="social-proof-stars social-proof-review-stars" aria-label="5 de 5 estrelas">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>“Excelente profissional! Recomendo sempre, pontualidade, flexibilidade, organização e limpeza do veículo. Cuidadoso no trânsito e ótimo papo.”</blockquote>
        <div class="social-proof-review-quote" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
      </article>

      <article class="social-proof-review" data-reveal="240">
        <div class="social-proof-review-head">
          <a class="social-proof-review-author" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/aCAXYqSYsQDSt7teA" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Ver avaliação de Fernanda Josias no Google">
            <span class="social-proof-review-name">Fernanda Josias</span><span class="mo-icon" data-mo-icon="external" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </a>
          <div class="social-proof-review-meta"><span>Google</span><time>Há 5 semanas</time></div>
        </div>
        <div class="social-proof-stars social-proof-review-stars" aria-label="5 de 5 estrelas">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>“Excelente profissional, super pontual e cuidadoso no trânsito.”</blockquote>
        <div class="social-proof-review-quote" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="social-proof-recognition" aria-label="Reconhecimentos recebidos na Uber">
      <div class="social-proof-recognition-lead"><span>Mais que viagens,<strong>reconhecimento.</strong></span></div>
      <div class="social-proof-recognition-item"><span class="mo-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i data-lucide="shield-check"></i></span><span>Motorista<br>parceiro</span></div>
      <div class="social-proof-recognition-item"><span class="mo-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i data-lucide="thumbs-up"></i></span><span>Ótimo<br>atendimento</span></div>
      <div class="social-proof-recognition-item"><span class="mo-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i data-lucide="car-front"></i></span><span>Carro limpo<br>e confortável</span></div>
      <div class="social-proof-recognition-item"><span class="mo-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i data-lucide="traffic-lights"></i></span><span>Cuidadoso<br>no trânsito</span></div>
      <div class="social-proof-recognition-end">Avaliações reais.<br>Resultados reais.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="servicos" class="section" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(243,239,228,.06)">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Quando faz sentido</p>
    <div class="split-head">
      <h2 class="title-lg">Para compromissos que pedem mais controle do trajeto.</h2>
      <p class="copy">Quando horário, bagagem, espera ou continuidade importam, o trajeto precisa ser combinado com antecedência.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <article class="card service-card" data-reveal="0"><div class="service-top"><span class="card-num">01</span><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--md" data-mo-icon="airport" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><h3>Aeroportos e rodoviárias</h3><p>Ida, chegada, bagagem e horário planejados com antecedência.</p></article>
      <article class="card service-card" data-reveal="80"><div class="service-top"><span class="card-num">02</span><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--md" data-mo-icon="meeting" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><h3>Reuniões e compromissos</h3><p>Deslocamento com hora marcada e tempo de trajeto pensado antes.</p></article>
      <article class="card service-card" data-reveal="160"><div class="service-top"><span class="card-num">03</span><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--md" data-mo-icon="health" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><h3>Consultas e exames</h3><p>Trajeto com calma, cuidado e atenção ao horário.</p></article>
      <article class="card service-card" data-reveal="0"><div class="service-top"><span class="card-num">04</span><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--md" data-mo-icon="event" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><h3>Eventos</h3><p>Chegada e saída combinadas antes do evento.</p></article>
      <article class="card service-card" data-reveal="80"><div class="service-top"><span class="card-num">05</span><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--md mo-icon--route" data-mo-icon="travel" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><h3>Viagens e deslocamentos</h3><p>Percursos fora da rotina, com rota e condições alinhadas antes.</p></article>
      <article class="card service-card" data-reveal="160"><div class="service-top"><span class="card-num">06</span><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--md" data-mo-icon="wait" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><h3>Espera e acompanhamento</h3><p>Quando combinado, permaneço disponível dentro da mesma demanda.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="por-que-agendar" class="section" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(243,239,228,.06)">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Por que agendar antes?</p>
    <div class="split-head">
      <h2 class="title-lg">Porque alguns trajetos não podem depender de improviso.</h2>
      <p class="copy">Se há voo, reunião, consulta, evento ou tempo de espera, combinamos antes o horário, a rota e os detalhes que fazem diferença.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-4">
      <article class="card reason-card" data-reveal="0"><div class="reason-top"><span class="card-num">01</span><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--md" data-mo-icon="schedule" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><h3>Horário combinado</h3><p>Definimos o horário antes da corrida.</p></article>
      <article class="card reason-card" data-reveal="80"><div class="reason-top"><span class="card-num">02</span><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--md mo-icon--route" data-mo-icon="route" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><h3>Rota pensada</h3><p>Trânsito, tempo e contexto entram no planejamento.</p></article>
      <article class="card reason-card" data-reveal="160"><div class="reason-top"><span class="card-num">03</span><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--md" data-mo-icon="communication" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><h3>Comunicação direta</h3><p>Você fala comigo do agendamento ao desembarque.</p></article>
      <article class="card reason-card" data-reveal="240"><div class="reason-top"><span class="card-num">04</span><span class="mo-icon mo-icon--md" data-mo-icon="details" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><h3>Menos ruído</h3><p>Origem, destino, espera e outros detalhes ficam alinhados antes.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
